Now that you know about my app, I want you to do research first and look for any, CLI's, API's, MCP's, Python libraries, or any existing open-source work that is out there that has the features or functions of what my app has. Then i want you to compile that into a PRD for my review. 
We don't need a big complex app starting off so we want to build this is phases. 
Let's get a quick win with our first version of the phase and then we'll start building out complexity over time. Go ahead and do that research and present to me the PRD for review.
